  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">[거꾸로교실&nbsp;학생&nbsp;소감문]</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br>수업진도가 매우 빨랐던 반에서 한 달 전에 받은 소감문입니다. 이번주에 진도가 끝난 다른 반에서 소감문을 또 받을 거긴 하지만, 생각날 때 올려봅니다.</p><p><br style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">두&nbsp;번째&nbsp;놈&nbsp;적은&nbsp;거&nbsp;보십니다.&nbsp;축구로&nbsp;치면&nbsp;공격수가&nbsp;골을&nbsp;넣으려는&nbsp;욕심이&nbsp;생기는&nbsp;것처럼&nbsp;정답을&nbsp;맞추려는&nbsp;욕심이&nbsp;생긴답니다.&nbsp;ㅎ&nbsp;이&nbsp;얘기&nbsp;울&nbsp;학교&nbsp;선생님들께&nbsp;하면&nbsp;매우&nbsp;놀라실&nbsp;놈입니다^^</span><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></p><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/231B2A34547C978138\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"480\" width=\"480\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20141129_094155_01.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_231B2A34547C978138F3E3\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/27222B34547C97812D\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"480\" width=\"480\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"NaverBlog_20141129_094156_02.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_27222B34547C97812DC8A4\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26298434547C978126\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"392\" width=\"392\" exif=\"{}\"